alid data. 4MHz / 5us command slots are the revised isolated-link study baseline." (at 101.6 292.1 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid dfab7d17-2fa5-5ccc-b687-98bb98f42e50)) (text "ADC response is pipelined; physical sample timestamps and invalid blanking/recovery intervals must be retained in software." (at 101.6 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left)) (uuid 6e17d3b6-bfb9-557a-8dc1-d6b1f18d7696)))
